# 🎮 Pixel FPS MASTER+

A retro, wave-based pixel FPS built with HTML5 Canvas and pure JavaScript.

![Screenshot](assets/screenshot.png)

## 🚀 Features
- 🔫 Weapon Switching (Pistol, Shotgun, SMG)
- 💥 Procedural Enemy Waves
- 📈 Level Scaling + Boss Fights
- 💉 Powerups (Medkits, Shields, Guns)
- 🗺️ Radar Minimap
- 💾 Save/Load System (LocalStorage)
- 🎨 Pixel Font & Sprites
- 🎮 Fully Playable in Browser or .exe Launcher

---

## 🧰 How to Play

| Action         | Input              |
|----------------|--------------------|
| Move           | `W`, `A`, `S`, `D` |
| Aim            | Mouse              |
| Shoot          | Left Click         |
| Reload         | `R`                |
| Switch Weapon  | `1`, `2`, `3`      |
| Open Shop      | `B`                |
| Pickups        | Walk over          |

